  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">使用 KubeJS<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/kubejs\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a> 自訂 Create<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a> 的 Ponder 場景。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">請閱讀 GitHub Wiki 尋找範例，或加入我們的 Discord 尋求協助。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">本模組是 PonderJS<a href=\"https://github.com/Create-Additions/Ponderjs\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a> 針對 <span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>1.18.2+</strong></span> 版本的延續</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f00\">。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">關於較舊版本，請參閱原始專案<a href=\"https://github.com/Create-Additions/Ponderjs\" rel=\"nofollow\">[連結]</a>。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>致謝</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kotakotik22/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">kotakotik22</a>&nbsp;對於原始專案的貢獻</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 團隊開發的 Ponder 系統</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>連結</strong></span><br><a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/ponderjs/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Wiki</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/AlmostReliable/ponderjs\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub Readme 頁面</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fThFnwZCyYY\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
